    {
      "flavor_text": "Sensitive to changing temperatures,\nthe bud blooms when it’s warm,\nreleasing toxic pollen.",
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "white-2",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/22/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "あたたかい　ひざしを　あびると\nつぼみが　ひらき　かふんを　とばす。\nきれいな　みずの　ちかくが　すみか。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja-hrkt",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/1/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "x",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/23/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "따뜻한 햇볕을 쬐면\n봉오리를 펴서 꽃가루를 날린다.\n깨끗한 물 가까이에 거처가 있다.",
      "language": {
        "name": "ko",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/3/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "x",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/23/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Son bourgeon s’ouvre une fois gorgé de soleil et\nlibère du pollen. Il vit près des sources d’eau pure.",
      "language": {
        "name": "fr",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/5/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "x",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/23/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Bei Sonnenlicht öffnet es seine Knospe und gibt\nPollen ab. Es lebt in der Nähe von sauberem Wasser.",
      "language": {
        "name": "de",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/6/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "x",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/23/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Vive cerca de aguas cristalinas. Su cabello se abre y\nesparce polen cuando le bañan los rayos del sol.",
      "language": {
        "name": "es",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/7/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "x",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/23/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "I raggi del sole gli fanno schiudere la gemma e\nrilasciare polline. Fa la tana vicino a bei corsi d’acqua.",
      "language": {
        "name": "it",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/8/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "x",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/23/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "When it feels the sun’s warm touch, it opens its bud\nto release pollen. It lives alongside clear pools.",
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "x",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/23/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "暖かい　日差しを　浴びると\nつぼみが　開き　花粉を　飛ばす。\nきれいな　水の　近くが　住処。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/11/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "x",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/23/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Vive cerca de aguas cristalinas. Su cabello se abre y\nesparce polen cuando le bañan los rayos del sol.",
      "language": {
        "name": "es-419",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/14/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "x",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/23/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "ふゆの　あいだは　つぼみを　とざして\nさむさに　たえる。はるになると\nつぼみを　ひらき　かふんを　とばす。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja-hrkt",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/1/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "y",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/24/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "겨울 동안 봉오리를 닫고\n추위를 견딘다. 봄이 되면\n봉오리를 펴서 꽃가루를 날린다.",
      "language": {
        "name": "ko",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/3/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "y",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/24/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "En hiver, son bourgeon se referme pour résister au\nfroid. Il s’ouvre au printemps et libère du pollen.",
      "language": {
        "name": "fr",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/5/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "y",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/24/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Im Winter schließt es die Knospe. Im Frühjahr\nöffnet es die Knospe und gibt Pollen ab.",
      "language": {
        "name": "de",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/6/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "y",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/24/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "En invierno cierra su capullo para protegerse del frío.\nEn primavera, el capullo se abre y esparce polen.",
      "language": {
        "name": "es",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/7/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "y",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/24/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "D’inverno chiude la sua gemma e resiste al freddo.\nIn primavera la gemma si riapre e rilascia polline.",
      "language": {
        "name": "it",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/8/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "y",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/24/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Over the winter, it closes its bud and endures the\ncold. In spring, the bud opens and releases pollen.",
